  "notes": [
    "The normal merge retains Context dock and responsive ownership together with AI price-pane placement, exact targets and chart observation callbacks.",
    "All six EN/ZH AI workspace cases open the reader through the visible entry, retain symbol/timeframe/pane identity, confirm the reader is outside the chart, delete one compound element, hide individual drawings and preserve the reader when Escape closes the AI manager.",
    "The three existing Context report commands were executed with the same named case and project selections, using owned port3590. No assertion, retry or skip was weakened.",
    "The 46-pass responsive report includes the six EN/ZH Options held-state, selected strike, pin, scroll and same-instance checks; nine existing viewport-inapplicable or duplicate transition skips retain their original scope.",
    "The complete 30-case Visual Intelligence matrix, eight phone Hub cases and 15 palette/template handoffs all pass without retries.",
    "All six ordinary/native placement images, eight Options state images and six Options offset receipts were actually regenerated. All24 PL6 and five Options axis captures were also executed at this source.",
    "The current Conductor and navigation evidence closures are unchanged by this merge and retain their actual earlier capture identities.",
    "Terminal is dark-only. These are actual local browser executions with declared repository/provider fixtures; ordinary-model analysis quality and production deployment are not established."
  ],
